sentences.text:
4. THE COMMISSIONER  CITY MUNICIPAL CORPORATION  GANDHI CHOWK  VIJAYAPURA-586 101  ...RESPONDENTS (BY SRI G.B.YADAV, HCGP FOR R1 TO R3;
 SRI A.M.NAGRAL, ADVOCATE FOR R4)
 THIS WRIT PETITION IS FILED UNDER ARTICLES 226 AND 227 OF THE CONSTITUTION OF INDIA, PRAYING TO DIRECT THE RESPONDENTS TO INITIATE ACQUISITION PROCEEDINGS IN RESPECT OF PETITIONER'S PROPERTY BEARING CTS.NO.1126/1C, WARD NO.2 SITUATED AT MAHATMA GANDHI ROAD, VIJAYAPURA, WITHIN STIPULATED TIME AND PAY PROPER COMPENSATION AND ETC.

Hence, I proceed to pass the following:
ORDER i) The writ petitions are allowed;
ii) Respondent No.2 is at liberty to acquire the properties of the petitioners in terms of the Right to Fair Compensation and Transparency Land Acquisition,
Rehabilitation and Resettlement Act, 2013 by issuing suitable necessary notification - 11 - NC: 2023:KHC-K:9093 within a period of sixty (60) days from the date of receipt of a copy of this order, failing which, respondent No.4 shall handover the possession of the properties of the petitioners within a period of 60 days thereafter, if not already acquired;
iii) Irrespective of the option chosen, the State shall make payment of damages towards the use of properties from the time of possession that was unauthorisedly taken to the date on which the possession is handed over at Rs.15 per sq.ft. per month being 0.5% on the value of the properties as agreed to be paid under the compromise in WP.No.207059/2014 and connected matters;
iv) As regards the damage cost to the petitioners in lieu of the unlawful demolition and taking away the properties of petitioners, the petitioners are at liberty to file a petition claiming damages;
v) In the event of respondent No.2 choosing to acquire the land, the acquisition shall be completed and necessary compensation be paid to the petitioners under the Right to Fair Compensation and - 12 - Bijapur District Central Co-Operative ... vs The State Of Karnatka And Ors on 7 December, 2023 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/176487885/
6 NC: 2023:KHC-K:9093 Transparency Land Acquisition, Rehabilitation and Resettlement Act, 2013

